  "description": "A .NET library providing ready-made Dear ImGui modal dialogs for collecting credentials. Ships username/password and token popups built on a shared CredentialPopup base, with masked input, automatic keyboard focus, and confirmation callbacks that hand back a ktsu.CredentialCache credential ready to store or use.",
